        <source>We need highly skilled and competent individuals with sufficient combat experience. Background in personal protection, station security or similar is highly desirable but not strictly necessary. If you are capable of effectively operating alone or as part of a small, specialized team, that will greatly improve your chances of being hired. I think it is needless to say that this line of work entails great danger, but in turn know that the monetary compensation we offer will be quite appropriate.

